1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,710
This loop is not just a story.

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:02,650
People need it.

3
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:09,760
Nearly half of employees admit putting non-public company data into AI tools, and more than one in four organisations have banned them over privacy.

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:15,630
Selling expertise is already big business, with expert networks alone above two and a half billion dollars a year.

5
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:20,150
And researchers have shown AI agents can be tricked into sending crypto they should never send.

6
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:22,290
Kalis earns from every use.

7
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:28,210
The seller gets paid, the community fund grows, and contributors earn royalties, so the marketplace funds its own improvement.

